{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve a start time for checkpointless context spans.** `on_child_context_end()` supplies `start_time=None` and captures `end_time` before this call. `_start_span()` consequently starts the span at materialization time, then ends it using an earlier timestamp, producing a negative duration and placing nested spans outside their parent. Retain the user-function start time with the placeholder or include it in the end hook, and test virtual and ReplayChildren context timing.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7pXeck","finding_digest":"ee05ceb83c71c5bda3f58d619fbc990d0dc6f26cedb601b46b212d7b26195b41","finding_id":"arf_v1_5yc45ob4ohc33i7vrvqz7pezbu","finding_key":"otel/execution_plugin.py::on_operation_end::checkpointless-context-timestamp-order","identity_key":"otel/execution_plugin.py::on_operation_end::checkpointless-context-timestamp-order","line":623,"observation_digest":"eb8d92166e829cecee10f46e4e3979ef15ee7c966b72a795a41c0bf1f7564878","observation_id":"aro_v1_5ogzeftoqkooz3qq6rxe4olz54","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-otel/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_otel/execution_plugin.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-02T14:35:12Z","review_id":"arr_v1_t6uybcwowwbijlesmbdes66ctp","reviewed_base_sha":"ea0bc35cef49b694999c0c2578ad3c76a381f844","reviewed_head_sha":"1d65bfb2afe19d529b7c2b3868efe172a4e145c6","reviewer":"codex","start_line":623,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":696},"record_id":"art_v1_jfovp23tadcwcj66g7fk4cgnnv","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-02T14:35:12Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
